      "title": {
        "en": "Cloud Backup",
        "zh": "云盘备份"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Deduplicated backup of the whole DSH home to Aliyun Drive: sessions, configs, agent files and plugin data. Overwritten files keep one old copy, renamed workspaces are never replaced, and a QR scan restores the environment and its plugins on a new machine.",
        "zh": "把整个 DSH 主目录按内容去重备份到阿里云盘：会话、配置、Agent 文件、插件数据一起走；被覆盖的文件自动留一份旧版，工作区改名不会被冲掉；扫码登录，换台电脑能把整套环境和插件装回来。"
      },
